Rule 8 (For a non-scalar tensor, each dimension of the input tensor x must have a size greater than 0)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 0 then ∀ i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
